{'symbol': 'CSGP', 'date': '2019-10-02 08:30:00', 'title': 'COSTAR GROUP TO ACQUIRE EQUITY INTERESTS OF STR, STRG FOR $450 MLN', 'text': 'COSTAR GROUP INC - ON SEPTEMBER 30, ENTERED INTO A SECURITIES PURCHASE AGREEMENT.COSTAR GROUP  - BUYERS WILL ACQUIRE ALL OF ISSUED & OUTSTANDING EQUITY INTERESTS OF EACH OF STR AND STRG FOR $450 MILLION.COSTAR - AGREEMENT MAY BE TERMINATED BY BUYERS OR SELLERS UNDER CERTAIN CIRCUMSTANCES, INCLUDING IF ACQUISITION IS NOT CONSUMMATED BY JAN 1, 2020.COSTAR - UPON TERMINATION OF AGREEMENT UNDER SPECIFIED CIRCUMSTANCES, BUYERS WILL BE REQUIRED TO PAY TO SELLERS A CASH TERMINATION FEE OF $22.5 MILLION.'}